WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.150
Genesis has two accounts of
how God made the first humans.

2
00:00:04.200 --> 00:00:07.670
In one, God forms a man
from the dust of the ground,

3
00:00:07.720 --> 00:00:09.780
and breathes life into him.

4
00:00:09.830 --> 00:00:13.340
Genesis says God created
humans in his own image,

5
00:00:13.390 --> 00:00:15.290
male and female.

6
00:00:15.340 --> 00:00:18.310
So if humans are made in the image of God,

7
00:00:18.360 --> 00:00:21.840
what follows for how
Catholics treat human life?

8
00:00:21.890 --> 00:00:25.610
In this mission, you'll compare the
two creation accounts in Genesis.

9
00:00:25.660 --> 00:00:28.620
Then you'll see what
follows from the image,

10
00:00:28.670 --> 00:00:31.600
from free will to caring for the earth.

11
00:00:31.650 --> 00:00:36.730
Your mission: find out what being made in
the image of God means for how Catholics

12
00:00:36.780 --> 00:00:38.030
treat human life.
